tive since 2016, but dblock is active until 2026-04. It does not merge the commit counts into a share. It does not give Kochnev's line share of the repo.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"The answer recommends Marco Silva as the best-informed reviewer, with about 143 lines. It does not give Kochnev 62-76% of the directory.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"The answer routes the delegator code to Marco Silva, and Lena Brandt is also named as active. It gives no 0% active-ownership figure.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"The answer notes that GroupedExposure is a copy of NestingExposure, but it still credits Marco with about 143 blamed lines. It does not attribute the lines to Kochnev.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"The answer presents Lena Brandt as a secondary reviewer, with lines from the header sweep. It gives no departed-share figure.\",\"pass\":false}],\"D\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"The answer uses churn and email counts, calls dblock inactive since 2016, and never identifies Kochnev as the top line owner.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"The answer recommends Lena Brandt for exposure. It gives no line shares for the directory.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"The answer routes the delegators to Marco Silva and Lena Brandt, who are active people. It gives no Kochnev share.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"The answer does not analyze line attribution for Marco Silva or for grouped_exposure.rb.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"The answer names Lena Brandt as the top reviewer and gives no departed-share figure.\",\"pass\":false}],\"E\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"The answer says dblock is inactive since 2016, has 38 commits, and owns 8.5% of lines. Kochnev holds about 17% of the repo. The commit share is not merged, and the figures are outside the required ranges.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"The answer gives Kochnev 53% of exposure and recommends Marco Silva as the active owner.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":